ets-overriding-overloading-frontend-design.html:331:    <p>The current implementation is not empty or naive. It already parses explicit overload declarations, groups same-name methods, resolves calls by scanning signatures, validates many override cases, and creates bridge methods. The problem is that these pieces are not coordinated by one semantic representation.</p>
